    "en": {
      "trackName": "BallSwipe: Slide Puzzle",
      "description": "Slide colored balls across the grid and match each one to its target position.\n\nBallSwipe is a sliding puzzle game with a simple concept and deep challenge. Drag in any direction — balls slide until they hit a wall, boundary, or another ball. Plan your moves carefully to solve each level.\n\nFEATURES\n- 1000 hand-crafted levels across 4 difficulties: Easy, Medium, Hard, and Evil\n- Grid sizes from 3×3 to 5×5\n- Three ball types: Red, Green, and Blue\n- Hints available when you need a nudge\n- Clean, distraction-free design\n- No time limits — solve at your own pace\n\nHOW TO PLAY\n1. Swipe a ball in any direction\n2. The ball slides until it hits an obstacle\n3. Move all balls to their target positions to complete the level\n\nWhether you enjoy a quick puzzle during a break or a tricky challenge to test your logic, BallSwipe offers puzzles for every skill level.",
